{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02763",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.74,
      "end_seconds": 3.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.07,
      "end_seconds": 9.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Okay, no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.97,
      "end_seconds": 15.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a widespread rash with fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.63,
      "end_seconds": 19.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.94,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "It's been five days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.09,
      "end_seconds": 27.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Sure. Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.41,
      "end_seconds": 44.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.61,
      "text": "It usually comes with a recent new medicine. The recent new medicine? That's been since last Tuesday. Mm, there was swollen glands, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.61,
      "end_seconds": 53.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "okay have you had a widespread rash with fever before or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.62,
      "end_seconds": 61.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "a bit a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.03,
      "end_seconds": 66.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Have you had any mouth sores, breathing difficulty or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.65,
      "end_seconds": 72.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "No mouth sores, breathing difficulty or blisters, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.05,
      "end_seconds": 76.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.17,
      "end_seconds": 79.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.83,
      "end_seconds": 83.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.75,
      "end_seconds": 86.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.86,
      "end_seconds": 105.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Right, are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.17,
      "end_seconds": 114.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.04,
      "end_seconds": 117.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.54,
      "end_seconds": 122.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.74,
      "end_seconds": 141.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.84,
      "end_seconds": 161.47,
      "duration_seconds": 18.63,
      "text": "Simvastatin i take it 20 milligrams, at night work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it i, I take something called allo... allopurinol, 300 milligrams, maybe, started four weeks ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.23,
      "end_seconds": 169.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.61,
      "end_seconds": 178.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.38,
      "end_seconds": 181.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.47,
      "end_seconds": 188.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Actually, I had part of my thyroid removed years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.98,
      "end_seconds": 194.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.15,
      "end_seconds": 198.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.92,
      "end_seconds": 202.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.67,
      "end_seconds": 210.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.41,
      "end_seconds": 239.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 38.5, heart rate 88. And blood pressure 126 over 75, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.35,
      "end_seconds": 245.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.86,
      "end_seconds": 249.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.85,
      "end_seconds": 264.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "there is a a widespread red rash, facial swelling, and your temperature is high with enlarged glands"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.8,
      "end_seconds": 268.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.35,
      "end_seconds": 272.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.55,
      "end_seconds": 293.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.85,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it's hard to say. A severe drug reaction is one possibility and a viral rash another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.13,
      "end_seconds": 297.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.12,
      "end_seconds": 327.08,
      "duration_seconds": 27.96,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a severe drug reaction do well once it's treated properly. Urgent blood tests is what I'd like next, for severe drug reaction. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. For this, prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once a day, until review. That's for severe drug reaction. Stop the allopurinol now and you need admission"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.47,
      "end_seconds": 338.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "and please bring the latest prescription or the the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.07,
      "end_seconds": 341.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "alright I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.14,
      "end_seconds": 345.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "let's review you straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.95,
      "end_seconds": 347.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Alright I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.29,
      "end_seconds": 353.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.36,
      "end_seconds": 357.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.18,
      "end_seconds": 360.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}